The '''Jerry Pond''' is a [[Location]] on {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

{{ZoneText|Break through the ice.|Try out &bice fishing&f.|Talk to Terry in his shack!}}

== Features == 
The '''Jerry Pond'''<nowiki/>'s surface naturally turns into {{Item|Ice}}, which can be broken. Breaking the ice reveals the water beneath, in which the player can fish up a variety of [[Sea Creatures#Winter|Winter Sea Creatures]]. Once the ice on the surface is broken, it will regenerate after a while and must be broken again to reach the water.

When a {{MobSprite|Reindrake}} spawns, {{NPCSprite|Gregory}} will spawn in, allowing the player to purchase a {{Item|Decent Bow}} and {{Item|Flint Arrow}}s.

=== Frozen Alex ===
{{Main|Frozen Alex}}
{{NPCSprite|Frozen Alex}} is an [[NPC]] in an igloo next to another frozen lake. They offer the player an [[Ice Essence Shop]], with {{Green|4}} unique perks, two of which are related to the [[Winter Island]]. Additionally, {{NPCSprite|Frozen Alex}} sells an {{Item|Enchanted Book|enchant=Experience V}} for {{Pink|15,000x}} {{Item|Ice Essence}}.

